polygon(50% 0%, 80% 10%, 100% 35%, 100% 70%, 80% 90%, 50% 100%, 20% 90%, 0% 70%, 0% 35%, 20% 10%);\",\"animation\":\"fadeInRight\",\"border_radius\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"15\",\"right\":\"15\",\"bottom\":\"15\",\"left\":\"15\",\"isLinked\":true}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"7f8aac98\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>At the core of every successful project is strategic, detail-oriented project management. Our experienced project managers lead with a hands-on approach, ensuring each phase of the process\\u2014initiation, planning, execution, monitoring, and close-out\\u2014is handled with precision and professionalism. We maintain full accountability for scope, schedule, budget, and quality control, facilitating day-to-day operations while keeping the broader project vision on track. Our team engages regularly with stakeholders, providing timely updates and proactive solutions to challenges as they arise.<\\/p>\",\"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_repeater\":[{\"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color\":\"#7C62FF\",\"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":50},\"_id\":\"d6b9fc5\"},{\"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color\":\"#FF6464\",\"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":90},\"_id\":\"0ed4c49\"}],\"_padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"20\",\"right\":\"20\",\"bottom\":\"20\",\"left\":\"20\",\"isLinked\":true},\"eael_image_masking_custom_clip_path\":\"clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 80% 10%, 100% 35%, 100% 70%, 80% 90%, 50% 100%, 20% 90%, 0% 70%, 0% 35%, 20% 10%);\",\"eael_image_masking_custom_clip_path_hover\":\"clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 80% 10%, 100% 35%, 100% 70%, 80% 90%, 50% 100%, 20% 90%, 0% 70%, 0% 35%, 20% 10%);\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"6468a569\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>Through detailed scheduling, resource planning, and cost tracking, we protect project integrity and reduce inefficiencies. By tailoring our project management strategies to each client\\u2019s unique needs, we offer a structured yet flexible framework that supports collaboration, decision-making, and successful outcomes. With SPD Contracting, clients are never left guessing\\u2014they\\u2019re informed, empowered, and supported every step of the way.<\\/p>\",\"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_repeater\":[{\"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color\":\"#7C62FF\",\"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":50},\"_id\":\"d6b9fc5\"},{\"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color\":\"#FF6464\",\"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":90},\"_id\":\"0ed4c49\"}],\"_padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"20\",\"right\":\"20\",\"bottom\":\"20\",\"left\":\"20\",\"isLinked\":true},\"eael_image_masking_custom_clip_path\":\"clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 80% 10%, 100% 35%, 100% 70%, 80% 90%, 50% 100%, 20% 90%, 0% 70%, 0% 35%, 20% 10%);\",\"eael_image_masking_custom_clip_path_hover\":\"clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 80% 10%, 100% 35%, 100% 70%, 80% 90%, 50% 100%, 20% 90%, 0% 70%, 0% 35%, 20% 10%);\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"96e98c1\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"40\",\"right\":\"40\",\"bottom\":\"40\",\"left\":\"40\",\"isLinked\":true},\"eael_image_masking_custom_clip_path\":\"clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 80% 10%, 100% 35%, 100% 70%, 80% 90%, 50% 100%, 20% 90%, 0% 70%, 0% 35%, 20% 10%);\",\"eael_image_masking_custom_clip_path_hover\":\"clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 80% 10%, 100% 35%, 100% 70%, 80% 90%, 50% 100%, 20% 90%, 0% 70%, 0% 35%, 20% 10%);\",\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"__globals__\":{\"background_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=secondary\"}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"07915de\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"show_load_more\":\"infinity\",\"show_load_more_text\":\"Load More\",\"excerpt_expanison_indicator\":\"...\",\"read_more_button_text\":\"