, 80% 10%, 100% 35%, 100% 70%, 80% 90%, 50% 100%, 20% 90%, 0% 70%, 0% 35%, 20% 10%);\",\"animation\":\"fadeInRight\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"525380f5\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>Our success is built on strong partnerships, and our subcontracting approach reflects that commitment. SPD Contracting maintains a trusted network of highly qualified subcontractors, each selected through a rigorous evaluation of technical capabilities, safety practices, work quality, and reliability. We cultivate long-term relationships with local subcontractors who share our values and consistently meet our high standards. Our project managers provide continuous oversight to ensure that subcontractor work aligns with project goals, complies with all regulations, and upholds the level of excellence our clients expect.<\\/p>\",\"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_repeater\":[{\"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color\":\"#7C62FF\",\"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":50},\"_id\":\"d6b9fc5\"},{\"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color\":\"#FF6464\",\"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":90},\"_id\":\"0ed4c49\"}],\"_padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"20\",\"right\":\"20\",\"bottom\":\"20\",\"left\":\"20\",\"isLinked\":true},\"eael_image_masking_custom_clip_path\":\"clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 80% 10%, 100% 35%, 100% 70%, 80% 90%, 50% 100%, 20% 90%, 0% 70%, 0% 35%, 20% 10%);\",\"eael_image_masking_custom_clip_path_hover\":\"clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 80% 10%, 100% 35%, 100% 70%, 80% 90%, 50% 100%, 20% 90%, 0% 70%, 0% 35%, 20% 10%);\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"1e02f085\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>Through open communication, coordinated scheduling, and a strong emphasis on accountability, we create a collaborative environment where all parties are working toward a common objective. This approach not only improves efficiency and quality but also allows us to remain agile and responsive to changing project needs, ensuring a seamless path to completion.<\\/p>\",\"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_repeater\":[{\"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color\":\"#7C62FF\",\"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":50},\"_id\":\"d6b9fc5\"},{\"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color\":\"#FF6464\",\"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":90},\"_id\":\"0ed4c49\"}],\"_padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"20\",\"right\":\"20\",\"bottom\":\"20\",\"left\":\"20\",\"isLinked\":true},\"eael_image_masking_custom_clip_path\":\"clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 80% 10%, 100% 35%, 100% 70%, 80% 90%, 50% 100%, 20% 90%, 0% 70%, 0% 35%, 20% 10%);\",\"eael_image_masking_custom_clip_path_hover\":\"clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 80% 10%, 100% 35%, 100% 70%, 80% 90%, 50% 100%, 20% 90%, 0% 70%, 0% 35%, 20% 10%);\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"1385dad\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"40\",\"right\":\"40\",\"bottom\":\"40\",\"left\":\"40\",\"isLinked\":true},\"eael_image_masking_custom_clip_path\":\"clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 80% 10%, 100% 35%, 100% 70%, 80% 90%, 50% 100%, 20% 90%, 0% 70%, 0% 35%, 20% 10%);\",\"eael_image_masking_custom_clip_path_hover\":\"clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 80% 10%, 100% 35%, 100% 70%, 80% 90%, 50% 100%, 20% 90%, 0% 70%, 0% 35%, 20% 10%);\",\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"__globals__\":{\"background_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=secondary\"}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"316703b4\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"show_load_more\":\"yes\",\"show_load_more_text\":\"Load More\",\"excerpt_expanison_indicator\":\"...\",\"read_more_button_text\":\"Learn More\",\"post_type\":\"expertise\",\"postgrid_image_height\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":300,\"sizes\":[]},\"eael_image_masking_custom_clip_path\":\"clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 80% 10%, 100% 35%, 100% 7