Apartments Renovations\\n\",\"header_size\":\"h1\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Montserrat\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":50,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_font_weight\":\"600\",\"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_repeater\":[{\"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color\":\"#7C62FF\",\"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":50},\"_id\":\"ee6243b\"},{\"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color\":\"#FF6464\",\"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":90},\"_id\":\"e7455cc\"}],\"_flex_align_self\":\"flex-start\",\"eael_image_masking_custom_clip_path\":\"clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 80% 10%, 100% 35%, 100% 70%, 80% 90%, 50% 100%, 20% 90%, 0% 70%, 0% 35%, 20% 10%);\",\"eael_image_masking_custom_clip_path_hover\":\"clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 80% 10%, 100% 35%, 100% 70%, 80% 90%, 50% 100%, 20% 90%, 0% 70%, 0% 35%, 20% 10%);\",\"_animation\":\"fadeInLeft\",\"__globals__\":{\"title_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=1eaf522\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"322f4e7\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"flex_align_items\":\"center\",\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"40\",\"right\":\"40\",\"bottom\":\"40\",\"left\":\"40\",\"isLinked\":true},\"eael_image_masking_custom_clip_path\":\"clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 80% 10%, 100% 35%, 100% 70%, 80% 90%, 50% 100%, 20% 90%, 0% 70%, 0% 35%, 20% 10%);\",\"eael_image_masking_custom_clip_path_hover\":\"clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 80% 10%, 100% 35%, 100% 70%, 80% 90%, 50% 100%, 20% 90%, 0% 70%, 0% 35%, 20% 10%);\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"456b9a84\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"container_type\":\"grid\",\"presetTitle\":\"Grid\",\"presetIcon\":\"eicon-container-grid\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"grid_columns_grid\":{\"unit\":\"fr\",\"size\":2,\"sizes\":[]},\"grid_rows_grid\":{\"unit\":\"fr\",\"size\":1,\"sizes\":[]},\"eael_image_masking_custom_clip_path\":\"clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 80% 10%, 100% 35%, 100% 70%, 80% 90%, 50% 100%, 20% 90%, 0% 70%, 0% 35%, 20% 10%);\",\"eael_image_masking_custom_clip_path_hover\":\"clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 80% 10%, 100% 35%, 100% 70%, 80% 90%, 50% 100%, 20% 90%, 0% 70%, 0% 35%, 20% 10%);\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"c113070\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>This project, now known as Skyline Apartments, was a comprehensive rehabilitation initiative to preserve and enhance 398 affordable housing units located in Ward 8 of Washington, D.C. The extensive scope of work included substantial interior and exterior improvements aimed at resolving critical maintenance concerns and significantly improving resident quality of life. Renovations featured high-efficiency windows, Energy Star-certified kitchen appliances, upgraded plumbing and HVAC systems, and comprehensive mold remediation. Accessibility improvements were made throughout the properties to ensure compliance with ADA standards.<\\/p>\",\"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_repeater\":[{\"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color\":\"#7C62FF\",\"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":50},\"_id\":\"ab8ffc0\"},{\"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color\":\"#FF6464\",\"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":90},\"_id\":\"fafe957\"}],\"_padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"20\",\"right\":\"20\",\"bottom\":\"20\",\"left\":\"20\",\"isLinked\":true},\"_element_width\":\"inherit\",\"_element_custom_width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":70,\"sizes\":[]},\"eael_image_masking_custom_clip_path\":\"clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 80% 10%, 100% 35%, 100% 70%, 80% 90%, 50% 100%, 20% 90%, 0% 70%, 0% 35%, 20% 10%);\",\"eael_image_masking_custom_clip_path_hover\":\"clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 80% 10%, 100% 35%, 100% 70%, 80% 90%, 50% 100%, 20% 90%, 0% 70%, 0% 35%, 20% 10%);\",\"_box_shadow_box_shadow_type\":\"yes\",\"_box_shadow_box_shadow\":{\"horizontal\":5,\"vertical\":5,\"blur\":10,\"spread\":0,\"color\":\"rgba(0,0,0,0.5)\"},\"_border_radius\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"15\",\"right\":\"15\",\"bottom\":\"15\",\"left\":\"15\",\"isLinked\":true}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"351c250e\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>Safety enhancements, including updated fire-safety systems and improved site security, were also key priorities. Additionally, the project featured the construction of a new, modern community office designed to foster resident engagement and support. The revitalization transformed these essential affordable housing communities, significantly enhancing living conditions and sustainability for residents.<\\/p>\",\"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_repeater\":[{\"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color\":\"#7C62FF\",\"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":50},\"_id\":\"ab8ffc0\"},{\"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color\":\"#FF6464\",\"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":90},\"_id\":\"fafe957\"}],\"_padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"20\",\"right\":\"20\",\"bottom\":\"20\",\"left\":\"20\",\"isLinked\":true},\"_element_width\":\"inherit\",\"_element_custom_width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":70,\"sizes\":[]},\"eael_image_masking_custom_clip_path\":\"clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 80% 10%, 100% 35%, 100% 70%, 80% 90%, 50% 100%, 20% 90%, 0% 70%, 0% 35%, 20% 10%);\",\"eael_image_masking_custom_clip_path_hover\":\"clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 80% 10%, 100% 35%, 100% 70%, 80% 90%, 50% 100%, 20% 90%, 0% 70%, 0% 35%, 20% 10%);\",\"_box_shadow_box_shadow_type\":\"yes\",\"_box_shadow_box_shadow\":{\"horizontal\":5,\"vertical\":5,\"blur\":10,\"spread\":0,\"color\":\"rgba(0,0,0,0.5)\"},\"_border_radius\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"15\",\"right\":\"15\",\"bottom\":\"15\",\"left\":\"15\",\"isLinked\":true}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"3fa75b9e\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"carousel_name\":\"Image Carousel\",\"c