 by DSLBD, as well as a Section 3 company certified by DHCD. Specializing in construction management, general contracting, and design-build services, we deliver exceptional results across educational, municipal, multifamily, and commercial facilities. With extensive self-performance capabilities, our experienced in-house teams provide superior craftsmanship in key trades, ensuring greater quality control, cost efficiency, and reliable project outcomes. By leveraging deep local market knowledge and a robust network of trusted subcontractors, we consistently deliver projects on budget and on time.<\\/p>\",\"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_repeater\":[{\"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color\":\"#7C62FF\",\"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":50},\"_id\":\"501bb2e\"},{\"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color\":\"#FF6464\",\"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":90},\"_id\":\"c35d2b0\"}],\"eael_image_masking_custom_clip_path\":\"clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 80% 10%, 100% 35%, 100% 70%, 80% 90%, 50% 100%, 20% 90%, 0% 70%, 0% 35%, 20% 10%);\",\"eael_image_masking_custom_clip_path_hover\":\"clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 80% 10%, 100% 35%, 100% 70%, 80% 90%, 50% 100%, 20% 90%, 0% 70%, 0% 35%, 20% 10%);\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"e13c47d\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"presetTitle\":\"Container\",\"presetIcon\":\"eicon-container\",\"grid_columns_grid\":{\"unit\":\"fr\",\"size\":2,\"sizes\":[]},\"eael_image_masking_custom_clip_path\":\"clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 80% 10%, 100% 35%, 100% 70%, 80% 90%, 50% 100%, 20% 90%, 0% 70%, 0% 35%, 20% 10%);\",\"eael_image_masking_custom_clip_path_hover\":\"clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 80% 10%, 100% 35%, 100% 70%, 80% 90%, 50% 100%, 20% 90%, 0% 70%, 0% 35%, 20% 10%);\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"flex_direction\":\"row\",\"flex_direction_tablet\":\"column\",\"grid_columns_grid_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"fr\",\"size\":1,\"sizes\":[]},\"grid_rows_grid_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"fr\",\"size\":2,\"sizes\":[]},\"flex_justify_content\":\"space-around\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":90,\"sizes\":[]},\"_flex_align_self\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"f324115\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"border_width\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"1\",\"right\":\"1\",\"bottom\":\"1\",\"left\":\"1\",\"isLinked\":true},\"box_shadow_box_shadow_type\":\"yes\",\"box_shadow_box_shadow\":{\"horizontal\":5,\"vertical\":5,\"blur\":10,\"spread\":0,\"color\":\"rgba(0,0,0,0.5)\"},\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"20\",\"right\":\"20\",\"bottom\":\"20\",\"left\":\"20\",\"isLinked\":true},\"_flex_align_self\":\"center\",\"eael_image_masking_custom_clip_path\":\"clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 80% 10%, 100% 35%, 100% 70%, 80% 90%, 50% 100%, 20% 90%, 0% 70%, 0% 35%, 20% 10%);\",\"eael_image_masking_custom_clip_path_hover\":\"clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 80% 10%, 100% 35%, 100% 70%, 80% 90%, 50% 100%, 20% 90%, 0% 70%, 0% 35%, 20% 10%);\",\"__globals__\":{\"border_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=text\"},\"border_radius\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"15\",\"right\":\"15\",\"bottom\":\"15\",\"left\":\"15\",\"isLinked\":true}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"131d715\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>At SPD Contracting, integrity and innovation drive our approach. Our senior leadership team maintains a hands-on role in every project, emphasizing proactive communication, meticulous planning, and advanced technology integration. We partner closely with our clients to create customized solutions that elevate communities, enhance infrastructure, and build lasting value.<\\/p><p>Our vision is to be the most trusted and reliable construction partner in the D.C. region, continuously elevating communities by building infrastructure that shapes the future. With a senior leadership team deeply committed to quality, compliance, and collaborative partnerships, we ensure lasting value for our clients, partners, and community stakeholders.<\\/p><p><br \\/>SPD Contracting, Inc.\\u2014Building Tomorrow\\u2019s Washington, D.C., Today.<\\/p>\",\"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_repeater\":[{\"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color\":\"#7C62FF\",\"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":50},\"_id\":\"501bb2e\"},{\"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color\":\"#FF6464\",\"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":90},\"_id\":\"c35d2b0\"}],\"eael_image_masking_custom_clip_path\":\"clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 80% 10%, 100% 35%, 100% 70%, 80% 90%, 50% 100%, 20% 90%, 0% 70%, 0% 35%, 20% 10%);\",\"eael_image_masking_custom_clip_path_hover\":\"clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 80% 10%, 100% 35%, 100% 70%, 80% 90%, 50% 100%, 20% 90%, 0% 70%, 0% 35%, 20% 10%);\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"fab4aa5\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/qmbqbrt0dq.wpdns.site\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/01\\/workforce.webp\",\"id\":99,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"_flex_align_self\":\"center\",\"eael_image_masking_custom_clip_path\":\"clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 80% 10%, 100% 35%, 100% 70%, 80% 90%, 50% 100%, 20% 90%, 0% 70%, 0% 35%, 20% 10%);\",\"eael_image_masking_custom_clip_path_hover\":\"clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 80% 10%, 100% 35%, 100% 70%, 80% 90%, 50% 100%, 20% 90%, 0% 70%, 0% 35%, 20% 10%);\",\"image_border_radius\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"15\",\"right\":\"15\",\"bottom\":\"15\",\"left\":\"15\",\"isLinked\":true},\"_flex_align_self_mobile\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"db1c166\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"40\",\"right\":\"40\",\"bottom\":\"40\",\"left\":\"40\",\"isLinked\":true},\"eael_image_masking_custom_clip_path\":\"clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 80% 10%, 100% 35%, 100% 70%, 80% 90%, 50% 1