rters-32-300x207.webp\" alt=\"\" />\n        <header><h2><a href=\"https://qmbqbrt0dq.wpdns.site/project/mpd-4th-district-headquarters/\" title=\"MPD 4th District Headquarters\">MPD 4th District Headquarters</a></h2></header>\n                        <p>SPD Contracting, Inc., as the Design-Builder, is overseeing the design and construction of the MPD 4th District Headquarters Generator Replacement...</p><a href=\"https://qmbqbrt0dq.wpdns.site/project/mpd-4th-district-headquarters/\">Learn More</a>\n    </article><article data-id=\"313\">\n            <a href=\"https://qmbqbrt0dq.wpdns.site/project/the-wall-at-o-street-se/\"></a>\n                <img width=\"300\" height=\"207\" src=\"https://qmbqbrt0dq.wpdns.site/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/The-Wall-at-O-Street-SE-53-300x207.webp\" alt=\"\" />\n        <header><h2><a href=\"https://qmbqbrt0dq.wpdns.site/project/the-wall-at-o-street-se/\" title=\"The Wall at O Street SE\">The Wall at O Street SE</a></h2></header>\n                        <p>The Design-Build Services for the O Street SE Retaining Wall Restoration project involve the structural rehabilitation and stabilization of the...</p><a href=\"https://qmbqbrt0dq.wpdns.site/project/the-wall-at-o-street-se/\">Learn More</a>\n    </article><article data-id=\"284\">\n            <a href=\"https://qmbqbrt0dq.wpdns.site/project/boone-es-emergency-repairs/\"></a>\n                <img width=\"300\" height=\"207\" src=\"https://qmbqbrt0dq.wpdns.site/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Boone-ES-Emergency-Repairs-71-300x207.webp\" alt=\"\" />\n        <header><h2><a href=\"https://qmbqbrt0dq.wpdns.site/project/boone-es-emergency-repairs/\" title=\"Boone ES Emergency Repairs\">Boone ES Emergency Repairs</a></h2></header>\n                        <p>Boone ES Emergency Repairs SPD Contracting, Inc. provided emergency restoration services at Boone Elementary School following water damage caused by...</p><a href=\"https://qmbqbrt0dq.wpdns.site/project/boone-es-emergency-repairs/\">Learn