able construction partner in the D.C. region, continuously elevating communities by building infrastructure that shapes the future. With a senior leadership team deeply committed to quality, compliance, and collaborative partnerships, we ensure lasting value for our clients, partners, and community stakeholders.</p><p><br />SPD Contracting, Inc.—Building Tomorrow’s Washington, D.C., Today.</p>													<img width=\"800\" height=\"517\" src=\"https://qmbqbrt0dq.wpdns.site/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/workforce-1024x662.webp\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://qmbqbrt0dq.wpdns.site/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/workforce-1024x662.webp 1024w, https://qmbqbrt0dq.wpdns.site/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/workforce-300x194.webp 300w, https://qmbqbrt0dq.wpdns.site/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/workforce-768x496.webp 768w, https://qmbqbrt0dq.wpdns.site/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/workforce.webp 1185w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" />','Company info','','inherit','closed','closed','','48-revision-v1','','','2026-01-27 20:40:10','2026-01-27 20:40:10','',48,'https://qmbqbrt0dq.wpdns.site/?p=144',0,'revision','',0),
