(512,2,'2026-01-28 19:31:18','2026-01-28 19:31:18','<h2>Educational Facilities\n</h2>					<h1>Randall Recreation Center Project</h1>		<p>The Randall Recreation Center project focuses on enhancing accessibility, safety, and functionality to better serve the community. The scope includes upgrades to the existing facility, improvements to recreational spaces, and enhancements to site infrastructure. Interior renovations modernize key areas, while outdoor upgrades create a more inviting and durable environment.</p><p>With a commitment to quality and sustainability, SPD Contracting, Inc. leads this project in collaboration with the A/E team to align with DPR’s mission of providing safe and engaging recreational spaces.</p>					\n								<figure><img src=\"https://qmbqbrt0dq.wpdns.site/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Randall-Recreation-Center-Project-41.webp\" alt=\"Randall-Recreation-Center-Project-41\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"https://qmbqbrt0dq.wpdns.site/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Randall-Recreation-Center-Project-40.webp\" alt=\"Randall-Recreation-Center-Project-40\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"https://qmbqbrt0dq.wpdns.site/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Randall-Recreation-Center-Project-39.webp\" alt=\"Randall-Recreation-Center-Project-39\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"https://qmbqbrt0dq.wpdns.site/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Randall-Recreation-Center-Project-37.webp\" alt=\"Randall-Recreation-Center-Project-37\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"https://qmbqbrt0dq.wpdns.site/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Randall-Recreation-Center-Project-38.webp\" alt=\"Randall-Recreation-Center-Project-38\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"https://qmbqbrt0dq.wpdns.site/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Randall-Recreation-Center-Project-36.webp\" alt=\"Randall-Recreation-Center-Project-36\" /></figure>			\n            <article data-id=\"357\">\n            <a href=\"https://qmbqbrt0dq.wpdns.site/project/randall-recreation-center-project/\"></a>\n                <img width=\"300\" height=\"207\" src=\