(520,2,'2026-01-28 19:33:38','2026-01-28 19:33:38','<h2>Government Housing\n</h2>					<h1>Forest Ridge and The Vistas Apartments Renovations\n</h1>		<p>This project, now known as Skyline Apartments, was a comprehensive rehabilitation initiative to preserve and enhance 398 affordable housing units located in Ward 8 of Washington, D.C. The extensive scope of work included substantial interior and exterior improvements aimed at resolving critical maintenance concerns and significantly improving resident quality of life. Renovations featured high-efficiency windows, Energy Star-certified kitchen appliances, upgraded plumbing and HVAC systems, and comprehensive mold remediation. Accessibility improvements were made throughout the properties to ensure compliance with ADA standards.</p><p>Safety enhancements, including updated fire-safety systems and improved site security, were also key priorities. Additionally, the project featured the construction of a new, modern community office designed to foster resident engagement and support. The revitalization transformed these essential affordable housing communities, significantly enhancing living conditions and sustainability for residents.</p>					\n								<figure><img src=\"https://qmbqbrt0dq.wpdns.site/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/desglose-web-SPD-2025-59.webp\" alt=\"desglose-web-SPD-2025-59\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"https://qmbqbrt0dq.wpdns.site/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/desglose-web-SPD-2025-58.webp\" alt=\"desglose-web-SPD-2025-58\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"https://qmbqbrt0dq.wpdns.site/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/desglose-web-SPD-2025-57.webp\" alt=\"desglose-web-SPD-2025-57\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"https://qmbqbrt0dq.wpdns.site/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/desglose-web-SPD-2025-55.webp\" alt=\"desglose-web-SPD-2025-55\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"https://qmbqbrt0dq.wpdns.site/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/desglose-web-SPD-2025-54.webp\" alt=\"desglose-web-SPD-2025-54\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"http