able construction partner in the D.C. region, continuously elevating communities by building infrastructure that shapes the future. With a senior leadership team deeply committed to quality, compliance, and collaborative partnerships, we ensure lasting value for our clients, partners, and community stakeholders.</p><p><br />SPD Contracting, Inc.—Building Tomorrow’s Washington, D.C., Today.</p>													<img width=\"800\" height=\"517\" src=\"https://qmbqbrt0dq.wpdns.site/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/workforce-1024x662.webp\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://qmbqbrt0dq.wpdns.site/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/workforce-1024x662.webp 1024w, https://qmbqbrt0dq.wpdns.site/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/workforce-300x194.webp 300w, https://qmbqbrt0dq.wpdns.site/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/workforce-768x496.webp 768w, https://qmbqbrt0dq.wpdns.site/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/workforce.webp 1185w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" />																										<img width=\"800\" height=\"490\" src=\"https://qmbqbrt0dq.wpdns.site/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/spd-construction-1024x627.webp\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://qmbqbrt0dq.wpdns.site/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/spd-construction-1024x627.webp 1024w, https://qmbqbrt0dq.wpdns.site/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/spd-construction-300x184.webp 300w, https://qmbqbrt0dq.wpdns.site/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/spd-construction-768x470.webp 768w, https://qmbqbrt0dq.wpdns.site/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/spd-construction.webp 1100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" />																<h2>Executive Leadership</h2>		<p>The leadership team at SPD Contracting, Inc. consists of seasoned construction industry veterans committed to excellence, integrity, and innovation. Proudly headquartered in Washington, D.C.’s Ward 5, our senior officers possess deep local expertise and share a collective vision dedicated to quality, honesty, and lasting client relationships.</p><p>Our senior executives leverage decades of experience managing projects throughout the District, Maryland, and Virginia (DMV) region. By combining local market expertise with advanced construction management techniques and cutting-edge technology, we ensure efficient project delivery tailored to each client\'s unique needs.</p><p>Our teams are thoughtfully assembled, harnessing in-house self-performance capabilities and the strengths of specialized subcontractors to deliver consistent, high-quality outcomes. We believe in transparent communication, proactive management, and building relationships based on mutual trust.</p><p>At SPD, we understand that success extends beyond project completion. We are deeply invested in the communities we serve across Washington, D.C., Maryland, and Virginia—committed to responsible building practices, sustainability, and LEED-certified approaches. Our expertise in sustainable construction not only supports environmental responsibility but also enhances long-term project value for our clients and the community.<br />Our shared vision for quality, integrity, and innovation drives us to continually improve and positively impact the communities we serve across the DMV region.</p>','Company info','','inherit','closed','closed','','48-revision-v1','','','2026-01-28 19:54:19','2026-01-28 19:54:19','',48,'https://qmbqbrt0dq.wpdns.site/?p=554',0,'revision','',0),
(555,2,'2026-01-28 19:54:20','2026-01-28 19:54:20','<h1>Our company</h1>		<p>SPD Contracting, Inc. specializes in diverse sectors such as Education, Private Ventures, Municipal Projects, &amp; Emergency Response-Oriented Endeavors.<br />SPD is committed to delivering innovative solutions to meet the unique needs of each project.</p>					\n				<a href=\"#story\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-label=\"Our Story\">\n				<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" id=\"Layer_1\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-name=\"Layer 1\"><path d=\"m7 15h-3v-2h3zm2 0h3v-2h-3zm-5 4h3v-2h-3zm5 0h3v-2h-3zm-2-14h-3v2h3zm2 2h3v-2h-3zm-2 2h-3v2h3zm2 2h3v-2h-3zm10 7c1.379 0 2.5-1.121 2.5-2.5s-1.121-2.5-2.5-2.5-2.5 1.121-2.5 2.5 1.121 2.5 2.5 2.5zm2 1h-4c-1.654 0-3 1.346-3 3v2h2v-2c0-.552.448-1 1-1h4c.552 0 1 .448 1 1v2h2v-2c0-1.654-1.346-3-3-3zm-7-4c0-1.63.792-3.065 2-3.977v-8.023c0-1.654-1.346-3-3-3h-10c-1.654 0-3 1.346-3 3v21h12v-2h-10v-19c0-.552.449-1 1-1h10c.552 0 1 .448 1 1z\"></path></svg>				</a>\n									<h3>\n						<a href=\"#story\" >\n							Our Story						</a>\n					</h3>\n				<a href=\"#leadership\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-label=\"Executive Leadership\">\n				<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" id=\"Layer_1\" data-name=\"Layer 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m24,3.668v.647l-2.837.841-.831,2.844h-.647l-.842-2.843-2.843-.842v-.647l2.844-.831.841-2.837h.647l.829,2.839,2.839.829Zm-19.5,1.332c1.381,0,2.5-1.119,2.5-2.5S5.881,0,4.5,0s-2.5,1.119-2.5,2.5,1.119,2.5,2.5,2.5Zm7.5,10h-4v-5h-2v5H2v-6c0-.551.448-1,1-1h5.283l6.741-4.148-1.049-1.703-6.259,3.852H3c-1.654,0-3,1.346-3,3v8h2v7h2v-7h6v3.051c-1.14.232-2,1.242-2,2.449v1.5h2v-1.5c0-.276.225-.5.5-.5h13.5v-2h-12v-5Zm-1-3.441l6.455-4.044-.222-.749-1.591-.471-4.642,2.916v2.349Z\"></path></svg>				</a>\n									<h3>\n						<a href=\"#leadership\" >\n							Executive Leadership						</a>\n					</h3>\n				<a href=\"#project\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-label=\"Projects\">\n				<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"512\" height=\"512\"><g id=\"_01_align_center\" data-name=\"01 align center\"><path d=\"M21,4H18V2a2,2,0,0,0-2-2H8A2,2,0,0,0,6,2V4H3A3,3,0,0,0,0,7V24H24V7A3,3,0,0,0,21,4ZM8,2h8V4H8ZM3,6H21a1,1,0,0,1,1,1v5H2V7A1,1,0,0,1,3,6ZM2,22V14h9v2h2V14h9v8Z\"></path></g></svg>				</a>\n									<h3>\n						<a href=\"#project\" >\n							Projects						</a>\n					</h3>\n																	<img width=\"579\" height=\"508\" src=\"https://qmbqbrt0dq.wpdns.site/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/rodolfo-gonzalez.webp\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://qmbqbrt0dq.wpdns.site/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/rodolfo-gonzalez.webp 579w, https://qmbqbrt0dq.wpdns.site/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/rodolfo-gonzalez-300x263.webp 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 579px) 100vw, 579px\" />																<h2>Our story</h2>		<p>SPD Contracting, Inc. is a local construction company proudly headquartered in Washington, D.C.\'s Ward 5. We are a minority-owned business and certified as a CBE, SBE, LBE, DZE, DBE, ROB, and EIE by DSLBD, as well as a Section 3 company certified by DHCD. Specializing in construction management, general contracting, and design-build services, we deliver exceptional results across educational, municipal, multifamily, and commercial facilities. With extensive self-performance capabilities, our experienced in-house teams provide superior craftsmanship in key trades, ensuring greater quality control, cost efficiency, and reliable project outcomes. By leveraging deep local market knowledge and a robust network of trusted subcontractors, we consistently deliver projects on budget and on time.</p><p>At SPD Contracting, integrity and innovation drive our approach. Our senior leadership team maintains a hands-on role in every project, emphasizing proactive communication, meticulous planning, and advanced technology integration. We partner closely with our clients to create customized solutions that elevate communities, enhance infrastructure, and build lasting value.</p><p>Our vision is to be the most trusted and reliable construction partner in the D.C. region, continuously elevating communities by building infrastructure that shapes the future. With a senior leadership team deeply committed to quality, compliance, and collaborative partnerships, we ensure lasting value for our clients, partners, and community stakeholders.</p><p><br />SPD Contracting, Inc.—Building Tomorrow’s Washington, D.C., Today.</p>													<img width=\"800\" height=\"517\" src=\"https://qmbqbrt0dq.wpdns.site/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/workforce-1024x662.webp\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://qmbqbrt0dq.wpdns.site/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/workforce-1024x662.webp 1024w, https://qmbqbrt0dq.wpdns.site/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/workforce-300x194.webp 300w, https://qmbqbrt0dq.wpdns.site/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/workforce-768x496.webp 768w, https://qmbqbrt0dq.wpdns.site/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/workforce.webp 1185w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" />																										<img width=\"800\" height=\"490\" src=\"https://qmbqbrt0dq.wpdns.site/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/spd-construction-1024x627.webp\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://qmbqbrt0dq.wpdns.site/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/spd-construction-1024x627.webp 1024w, https://qmbqbrt0dq.wpdns.site/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/spd-construction-300x184.webp 300w, https://qmbqbrt0dq.wpdns.site/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/spd-construction-768x470.webp 768w, https://qmbqbrt0dq.wpdns.site/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/spd-construction.webp 1100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" />																<h2>Executive Leadership</h2>		<p>The leadership team at SPD Contracting, Inc. consists of seasoned construction industry veterans committed to excellence, integrity, and innovation. Proudly headquartered in Washington, D.C.’s Ward 5, our senior officers possess deep local expertise and share a collective vision dedicated to quality, honesty, and lasting client relationships.</p><p>Our senior executives leverage decades of experience managing projects throughout the District, Maryland, and Virginia (DMV) region. By combining local market expertise with advanced construction management techniques and cutting-edge technology, we ensure efficient project delivery tailored to each client\'s unique needs.</p><p>Our teams are thoughtfully assembled, harnessing in-house self-performance capabilities and the strengths of specialized subcontractors to deliver consistent, high-quality outcomes. We believe in transparent communication, proactive management, and building relationships based on mutual trust.</p><p>At SPD, we understand that success extends beyond project completion. We are deeply invested in the communities we serve across Washington, D.C., Maryland, and Virginia—committed to responsible building practices, sustainability, and LEED-certified approaches. Our expertise in sustainable construction not only supports environmental responsibility but also enhances long-term project value for our clients and the community.<br />Our shared vision for quality, integrity, and innovation drives us to continually improve and positively impact the communities we serve across the DMV region.</p>','Company info','','inherit','closed','closed','','48-revision-v1','','','2026-01-28 19:54:20','2026-01-28 19:54:20','',48,'https://qmbqbrt0dq.wpdns.site/?p=555',0,'revision','',0),
